{"seq":3,"slug":"notification-timeline-regulator-interface-map","title":"分法域通报时限、报告义务与监管接口矩阵","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-product-recall-safety-response/recall-regime-liability-model/notification-timeline-regulator-interface-map","wordCount":2489,"readingTime":10,"html":"<h1 id=\"分法域通报时限-报告义务与监管接口矩阵\">分法域通报时限、报告义务与监管接口矩阵</h1><p>同一件产品缺陷，在洛杉矶是 24 小时、在布鲁塞尔是两个工作日、在悉尼与渥太华是两天，在东京则取决于是否属于「重大事故」。企业真正要交付的不是一份「合规说明」，而是一个能把「事件发生时刻」翻译成「各法域应答时刻」的计时引擎，以及一张把每一条义务路由到正确监管入口的接口表。本文拆解这套引擎的判定逻辑、时限口径与接口形态。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-报告义务的三层结构\">核心概念：报告义务的三层结构</h2><p>任何一条通报义务都可以拆成三要素：<strong>触发判据</strong>（什么事实让义务成立）、<strong>时限口径</strong>（从哪时刻起、按什么日历算）、<strong>监管接口</strong>（报文送到谁手里、走什么通道、用什么单据回执）。三者必须一起建模，因为工程事故几乎都发生在它们的接缝上——判据用了伤害口径而规则用的是缺陷口径，时限用了自然日而规则用的是工作日，接口报给了门户而回执口径却是本地执法机构。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  E[安全事件被感知] --&gt; T{触发判据命中?}&#10;  T --&gt;|否| L[记录不报告理由&lt;br/&gt;留存评估版本]&#10;  T --&gt;|是| C{按法域换算应答时刻}&#10;  C --&gt; US[&quot;US: aware + 24h&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; EU[&quot;EU: aware + 2 工作日&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; AU[&quot;AU: aware + 2 天&quot;]&#10;  C --&gt; CA[&quot;CA: aware + 2 天&quot;]&#10;  US --&gt; R{选择接口}&#10;  EU --&gt; R&#10;  AU --&gt; R&#10;  CA --&gt; R&#10;  R --&gt; P[&quot;门户直报&lt;br/&gt;Business Gateway / CPSC&quot;]&#10;  R --&gt; M[&quot;平台中转&lt;br/&gt;线上市场联络点&quot;]&#10;  P --&gt; A[回执编号 + 补充更新]&#10;  M --&gt; A&#10;  A --&gt; S[&quot;SUPPLEMENTING&lt;br/&gt;新信息持续补报&quot;]\">graph TD\n  E[安全事件被感知] --&gt; T{触发判据命中?}\n  T --&gt;|否| L[记录不报告理由&lt;br/&gt;留存评估版本]\n  T --&gt;|是| C{按法域换算应答时刻}\n  C --&gt; US[\"US: aware + 24h\"]\n  C --&gt; EU[\"EU: aware + 2 工作日\"]\n  C --&gt; AU[\"AU: aware + 2 天\"]\n  C --&gt; CA[\"CA: aware + 2 天\"]\n  US --&gt; R{选择接口}\n  EU --&gt; R\n  AU --&gt; R\n  CA --&gt; R\n  R --&gt; P[\"门户直报&lt;br/&gt;Business Gateway / CPSC\"]\n  R --&gt; M[\"平台中转&lt;br/&gt;线上市场联络点\"]\n  P --&gt; A[回执编号 + 补充更新]\n  M --&gt; A\n  A --&gt; S[\"SUPPLEMENTING&lt;br/&gt;新信息持续补报\"]</pre><p>三层结构的关键含义是：「报告」不是动作，而是一条状态机的边。企业可以在判据成立时先送初始报文，再随新信息补充更正；不能因为内部调查未完成就推迟送报——推迟本身就是违规，与产品最终是否真有缺陷无关。</p>\n<h2 id=\"通报时限的分法域对照矩阵\">通报时限的分法域对照矩阵</h2><p>各法域的时限差异不只是数字不同，计时起算点与日历口径也不一样。下表的「起算点」一列是实务中最容易漏配的字段：多数规则从「知悉」起算，而「知悉」在规则文本中往往被定义为「有合理信息表明」而非「内部确认完成」。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>法域</th>\n<th>主要依据</th>\n<th>触发判据</th>\n<th>时限</th>\n<th>起算点与日历</th>\n<th>报送接口</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>美国</td>\n<td>CPSA §15(b)，<a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/uscode/text/15/2064\">15 U.S.C. § 2064</a></td>\n<td>违反安全规则／缺陷构成重大产品危害／不合理重伤死亡风险</td>\n<td>立即（实务 24 小时）</td>\n<td>获得信息起算，自然时长</td>\n<td>CPSC 合规与执法办公室，<a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/cfr/text/16/1115.14\">16 CFR § 1115.14</a></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>欧盟</td>\n<td>GPSR (EU) 2023/988，<a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2023/988/oj\">EUR-Lex</a></td>\n<td>产品不符合要求／存在严重产品安全风险</td>\n<td>尽快；严重风险事故两个工作日</td>\n<td>知悉起算，工作日</td>\n<td>成员国主管机构，经 Safety Business Gateway</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>英国</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.legislation.gov.uk/uksi/2005/1803/contents\">General Product Safety Regulations 2005</a> reg. 9</td>\n<td>生产者已知产品不安全</td>\n<td>尽快</td>\n<td>知悉起算</td>\n<td>地方贸易标准部门 / OPSS</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>澳大利亚</td>\n<td>ACL 强制报告义务，<a href=\"https://www.accc.gov.au/business/product-safety/mandatory-reporting\">ACCC</a></td>\n<td>死亡、严重伤害或疾病</td>\n<td>2 天</td>\n<td>知悉起算，自然日</td>\n<td>ACCC Product Safety</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加拿大</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://laws-lois.justice.gc.ca/eng/acts/c-1.68/\">CCPSA</a></td>\n<td>健康或安全事件、缺陷、召回</td>\n<td>2 天</td>\n<td>知悉起算，自然日</td>\n<td>Health Canada</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中国</td>\n<td><a href=\"https://www.samr.gov.cn/\">《消费品召回管理暂行规定》</a>（市场监管总局令）</td>\n<td>确认消费品存在缺陷</td>\n<td>3 个工作日</td>\n<td>确认缺陷起算，工作日</td>\n<td>市场监管部门，经全国消费品召回信息平台</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这条表最实用的读法是横向看「时限」与「起算点」两列的错配：欧盟与中国按工作日、美澳加按自然日；欧盟与中国从「知悉／确认缺陷」起算，美国从「获得信息」起算。把全部法域的倒计时都用一个自然日阈值统一配置，会同时产生两种错误——对中国、欧盟算得太宽（跨周末时实际更晚到期），对美澳加算得太紧（周末被无意义地消耗）。正确做法是把工作日日历建模为法域属性，而不是全局常量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"监管接口的三种形态\">监管接口的三种形态</h2><p>接口形态决定了「报给谁」和「报文如何被转述」。跨境场景下有三种形态，它们不是替代关系，同一事件往往需要同时走两条通道。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A1[企业合规系统] --&gt;|JSON/表单| A2[Business Gateway]&#10;  A1 --&gt;|Section 15(b) 报告| A3[CPSC portal]&#10;  A2 --&gt; A4[成员国主管机构评估]&#10;  A4 --&gt; A5[Safety Gate 周度预警]&#10;  B1[线上市场卖家中心] --&gt; B2[平台合规联络点]&#10;  B2 --&gt; B3[平台按 GPSR/DSA 义务下架]&#10;  B2 --&gt; B4[平台转报主管机构]\">flowchart TD\n  A1[企业合规系统] --&gt;|JSON/表单| A2[Business Gateway]\n  A1 --&gt;|Section 15(b) 报告| A3[CPSC portal]\n  A2 --&gt; A4[成员国主管机构评估]\n  A4 --&gt; A5[Safety Gate 周度预警]\n  B1[线上市场卖家中心] --&gt; B2[平台合规联络点]\n  B2 --&gt; B3[平台按 GPSR/DSA 义务下架]\n  B2 --&gt; B4[平台转报主管机构]</pre><p>三者的边界：<strong>门户直报</strong>是企业作为经济经营者主动履行义务的通道，回执编号由企业留存；它证明「报了」，不证明「主管机构认可了」。<strong>平台中转</strong>是线上市场在 GPSR、DSA 等框架下承担自身义务的通道，平台下架不能替代企业向主管机构报告——这是两条独立的义务线。<strong>本地执法</strong>是英国脱欧后与欧盟机制分离的路径，其时限口径（尽快）没有量化，内部仍应按更严的法域设计倒计时。</p>\n<p>接口建模中一个反复出现的缺陷是把「报告完成」当成终态。实际状态机在 <code>REPORTED</code> 之后还有 <code>SUPPLEMENTING</code>：当获得产品数量、制造与分销日期、各环节持有数量等新信息时，必须持续补充更正。美国侧的口头初始报告须在 48 小时内书面确认（<a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/cfr/text/16/1115.13\">16 CFR § 1115.13</a>），这条规则本身就是「先报后补」被制度化的证据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"报告义务的触发判定与内部计时引擎\">报告义务的触发判定与内部计时引擎</h2><p>把规则写成代码，核心是一个从「事件时刻」到「各法域应答时刻」的映射。设事件被合理知悉的时刻为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>aware</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{aware}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">aware</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，法域 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>j</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span></span> 的容许窗口为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则该法域的应答时刻为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">add_business_days</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>aware</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mtext>cal</mtext><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T_j = \\operatorname{add\\_business\\_days}(t_{\\text{aware}}, \\Delta_j, \\text{cal}_j)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">add_business_days</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">aware</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cal</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>cal</mtext><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{cal}_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cal</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是该法域的工作日历（周末与法定节假日集合）。对美国、澳大利亚、加拿大这类自然日口径，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">add_business_days</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\operatorname{add\\_business\\_days}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">add_business_days</span></span></span></span></span></span> 退化为普通日历加法；对欧盟与中国，必须传入对应日历。企业的全局响应阈值取所有在售法域的最小值：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>escalate</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mrow><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mtext>markets</mtext></mrow></munder><msub><mi>T</mi><mi>j</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{escalate}} = \\min_{j \\in \\text{markets}} T_j</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">escalate</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.5715em;vertical-align:-0.8882em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3479em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"mrel mtight\">∈</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">markets</span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8882em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其工程含义是：一次事件可能同时命中多法域，首次升级触发点必须取最早到期的那个，而不是某一个「主市场」的时限。对同时在北美与欧盟销售的商品，最小项通常是美国的 24 小时窗口。</p>\n<p>触发判据本身应被表达为布尔析取，而不是单一风险等级。以美国侧为例，义务在下列任一条件成立时触发：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>reportable</mtext><mtext>US</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mtext>violation</mtext><mo>∨</mo><mtext>substantial_hazard</mtext><mo>∨</mo><mtext>unreasonable_risk</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{reportable}_{\\text{US}} = \\text{violation} \\lor \\text{substantial\\_hazard} \\lor \\text{unreasonable\\_risk}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">reportable</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2342em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">US</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">violation</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">substantial_hazard</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∨</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">unreasonable_risk</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>三项是并列的独立触发线，其中「违反适用安全规则」无需另证伤害。把判据实现为 <code>violation OR hazard</code> 而不是 <code>hazard AND injury</code>，是防止漏报的第一道闸门。事件记录至少需携带以下字段：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;event_id&quot;: &quot;PS-2026-0918-001&quot;,&#10;  &quot;aware_at&quot;: &quot;2026-09-18T09:12:00Z&quot;,&#10;  &quot;triggers&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;US&quot;: { &quot;basis&quot;: &quot;15b&quot;, &quot;window&quot;: &quot;24h&quot;, &quot;calendar&quot;: &quot;natural&quot; },&#10;    &quot;EU&quot;: { &quot;basis&quot;: &quot;serious_risk&quot;, &quot;window&quot;: &quot;2wd&quot;, &quot;calendar&quot;: &quot;EU-BE&quot; },&#10;    &quot;CN&quot;: { &quot;basis&quot;: &quot;samr_recall&quot;, &quot;window&quot;: &quot;3wd&quot;, &quot;calendar&quot;: &quot;CN&quot; }&#10;  },&#10;  &quot;interfaces&quot;: [&quot;cpsc_portal&quot;, &quot;safety_business_gateway&quot;],&#10;  &quot;supplement_open&quot;: true&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"event_id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"PS-2026-0918-001\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"aware_at\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2026-09-18T09:12:00Z\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"triggers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"US\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"15b\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"window\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"24h\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"calendar\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"natural\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"EU\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"serious_risk\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"window\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"2wd\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"calendar\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"EU-BE\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"CN\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"basis\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"samr_recall\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"window\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"3wd\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"calendar\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"CN\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"interfaces\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cpsc_portal\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"safety_business_gateway\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"supplement_open\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>一条常被忽略的分支是「不报告」也是决定。当三项触发线都未命中时，系统必须落库一条否定记录，附带评估所用的判据版本与理由。监管问询时，「我们当时判断不构成可报告」若拿不出书面依据，等价于「我们没有评估」。因此 <code>ASSESSING → NOT_REPORTABLE</code> 必须写审计日志，其重要性不低于 <code>REPORT_DUE → REPORTED</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见误判与工程化落地\">常见误判与工程化落地</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>误判</th>\n<th>真实后果</th>\n<th>纠正</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>等内部调查完成再报告</td>\n<td>超出 24 小时窗口，违规与结论无关</td>\n<td>先送初始报文，随新信息补充</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用同一自然日阈值覆盖所有法域</td>\n<td>工作日口径法域被误判为到期／未到期</td>\n<td>日历作为法域属性，倒计时分法域计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平台下架即视为已履行报告义务</td>\n<td>企业仍须向主管机构报告</td>\n<td>平台动作与法定报告分别建模、分别留证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>只报已发生的伤害</td>\n<td>漏掉「违反规则本身即触发」分支</td>\n<td>判据实现为逻辑析取，非合取</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>报告即终态</td>\n<td>未执行补充更新，形成持续违规</td>\n<td>保留 SUPPLEMENTING 并设补报触发器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用口头报告了事</td>\n<td>缺 48 小时内书面确认</td>\n<td>口头通道强制绑定书面确认倒计时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>落地时的最小架构是三个组件：<strong>判据库</strong>（把各法域触发条件表示为可版本化的布尔表达式，法规变更时按 reference 定位受影响条目）、<strong>日历服务</strong>（按法域提供工作日集合，跨时区以 UTC 存储、按目标法域时区解释）、<strong>接口路由表</strong>（每条义务映射到通道、报文 schema 与回执字段）。公共主键 <code>rule_id</code> 保证规则可追溯，<code>event_id</code> 保证事件全生命周期可审计。</p>\n<p>最容易失败的地方是<strong>时区与日历的边界</strong>。东八区上午十点发生的事件，对应布鲁塞尔的凌晨、洛杉矶的前一日傍晚；按 UTC 存储 <code>aware_at</code> 能消除歧义，但「知悉」的判定时点应由最早知悉该信息的法人实体所在地决定，而非服务器时区。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>通报义务 = 触发判据 + 时限口径 + 监管接口，三者一起建模，接缝处是缺陷高发区。</li>\n<li>时限差异不仅在数字，更在起算点（知悉 vs 获得信息）与日历（自然日 vs 工作日）。</li>\n<li>全局升级触发点取所有在售法域的最早到期时刻，通常由美国的 24 小时窗口决定。</li>\n<li>触发判据是逻辑析取，违反规则本身即触发，无需附伤害证据。</li>\n<li>平台下架与法定报告是两条独立义务线，不能互相替代。</li>\n<li>报告窗口内如何选择自愿或强制通道、账单落在谁头上，见同 hub 的 <a href=\"mandatory-voluntary-recall-decision-mechanism\">强制召回与自愿召回的判定机制及平台-卖家-供应商责任分配</a>。</li>\n<li>「不报告」也是决定，必须落库理由与判据版本。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>参考来源：</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/uscode/text/15/2064\">15 U.S.C. § 2064 — Cornell LII</a>（CPSA §15(b) 触发情形与「立即告知」）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/cfr/text/16/1115.14\">16 CFR § 1115.14 — Cornell LII</a>（24 小时口径、内部评估不超 10 天、签署要求）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.law.cornell.edu/cfr/text/16/1115.13\">16 CFR § 1115.13 — Cornell LII</a>（初始报告内容、48 小时书面确认）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://eur-lex.europa.eu/eli/reg/2023/988/oj\">GPSR (EU) 2023/988 — EUR-Lex</a>（严重风险报告义务与 Safety Business Gateway 通道）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://europa.eu/youreurope/business/product-rules-compliance/product-safety-and-liability/selling-products-safely/index_en.htm\">Selling products safely in the EU — Your Europe</a>（经 Safety Business Gateway 报告已采取措施）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.legislation.gov.uk/uksi/2005/1803/contents\">General Product Safety Regulations 2005 — legislation.gov.uk</a>（英国生产者与分销商通知义务）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.accc.gov.au/business/product-safety/mandatory-reporting\">Mandatory reporting — ACCC</a>（澳大利亚两日强制报告）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://laws-lois.justice.gc.ca/eng/acts/c-1.68/\">Consumer Product Safety Act — Justice Laws Canada</a>（加拿大健康安全事件两日报告）</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.samr.gov.cn/\">消费品召回管理暂行规定 — 国家市场监督管理总局</a>（中国缺陷报告与召回程序）</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分法域通报时限、报告义务与监管接口矩阵","id":"分法域通报时限-报告义务与监管接口矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：报告义务的三层结构","id":"核心概念-报告义务的三层结构"},{"level":2,"text":"通报时限的分法域对照矩阵","id":"通报时限的分法域对照矩阵"},{"level":2,"text":"监管接口的三种形态","id":"监管接口的三种形态"},{"level":2,"text":"报告义务的触发判定与内部计时引擎","id":"报告义务的触发判定与内部计时引擎"},{"level":2,"text":"常见误判与工程化落地","id":"常见误判与工程化落地"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"强制召回与自愿召回的判定机制及平台-卖家-供应商责任分配","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-product-recall-safety-response/recall-regime-liability-model/mandatory-voluntary-recall-decision-mechanism"},"next":{"title":"安全信号来源分类、采集与归一化数据模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/crossborder-product-recall-safety-response/safety-signal-risk-data-system/safety-signal-source-taxonomy"}}